WEBVTT

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:04.528
nisikilize mimi soma kitabu,
na raha ya dunia utaipata tena."

00:18:05.579 --> 00:18:08.441
Ningependelea kumalizia na hili wazo:

00:18:08.465 --> 00:18:10.976
Kwamba pale tunapokataa hadithi moja,

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.976
tunapogundua kwamba hakuna hadithi moja

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.441
kuhusu sehemu yoyote,

00:18:16.465 --> 00:18:17.976
huwa tunarejesha Furaha.

00:18:18.695 --> 00:18:19.817
Asante.

00:18:19.841 --> 00:18:22.841
(Makofi)